       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. S30152.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-FORM2           PIC X(40).
       01  WS-PAGE2           PIC X(80).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           DISPLAY 'START'.
           GOBACK.

       ECHO-NAME2.
           EXEC CICS WEB READ FORMFIELD('name') VALUE(WS-FORM2) END-EXEC.
           STRING '<p>' WS-FORM2 '</p>' DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-PAGE2.
           EXEC CICS WEB SEND FROM(WS-PAGE2) END-EXEC.

